# Operations: Incident priority sorting

Load examples/business/data/incident_report.txt as Incident Report
Alias Incident Report as Incident

Find severity and save as severity
Find affected users and save as affected_users

priority equals "normal"

If severity is missing
  priority equals "review"

If severity is high
  priority equals "urgent"

If affected_users is missing
  priority equals "review"

Route priority to incident_response_queue
